Nikolay "'''nkl'''" Krastev {{born}} is a [[retired]] [[:Category:Bulgaria|Bulgarian]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike]]'' player.

He was previously [[banned]] from [[Valve]]-sponsored events due to a VAC ban issued on December 26, 2017. He was unbanned on December 24, 2022, due to ''Counter-Strike''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s "New RMR Eligibility Guidelines" blog post. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://blog.counter-strike.net/index.php/2021/04/33750/|title=New RMR Eligibility Guidelines|date=2021-04-15|publisher=[[Valve]]}}</ref>

